      "author": "Hollowmere team",
      "story": "Dana Merrow left her kids a note on the fridge and went to find her husband at the Okafor farm. He came back first. The kids dragged the couch and the dresser against the front door and never opened it. When he finally got in through the kitchen window they slipped out the back, bolted it behind them and ran for the ranger station. He is still in the hallway, outside the room they hid in.",
